  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Emergency Appeal Earthquake Victims in Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On Feb 6, two strong earthquakes struck Turkiye and Syria. As of today, more than 19,300  dead, 70,000 wounded, 23 million people affected, tens of thousands of people left homeless. With 20 years of expertise in Syria, Jafra has the potential to assist the country&apos;s inhabitants in times of catastrophes and is on the scene to attend to the most immediate needs especially in Aleppo, Al-Ramel, Handarat and Al-Neirab Palestinian camps. Thousands of people will find shelter thanks to your support.</narrative>
  </description>
